                                                "text": "Near-synonym: town hall"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a43b17b-c48e-43ff-80b5-6e58f68c6390",
                                                "sense_id": "74f3e49b-73fa-36e1-8df4-c631dd658e0c",
                                                "text": "A new city hall was built after the big fire of 1883."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cd5e7b7-f176-4ff6-ba8d-472f3a985835",
                                                "sense_id": "74f3e49b-73fa-36e1-8df4-c631dd658e0c",
                                                "text": "The vice-mayor has an office on the third floor of city hall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "669fa4eb-63c8-372b-b951-7ddca27370c5",
                                        "entry_id": "09a3fece-3c61-33ec-a727-fdcad84ed84e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The city government (city council, mayor, etc.); government in general."
